{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14211390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14211390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1421139001:1":{"text":"저기, 샤로 씨. 죄송해요! 크리스탈 솔트를 가지러 왔는데요.","source_cn":"那个，莎露小姐，打扰一下！我们是来拿幻晶盐粉的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD609E7F63D9CB7FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421139002:1":{"text":"예약은요?","source_cn":"有预定吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5458C3971F41F3E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421139003:1":{"text":"사리에 님이 예약하신 물건이에요.","source_cn":"是沙利叶大人让我们来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24F7A5FE89FEDBD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421139004:1":{"text":"사리에 님의 예약이군요! 하지만 그게... 제가 지금 좀 바빠서 직접 가져가셔야 할 것 같아요.","source_cn":"原来是沙利叶大人的预定！不过……我现在有点忙，你们自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE150CCAB6AEACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421139005:1":{"text":"보라색 자루에 들어 있는 거예요!","source_cn":"紫色袋子的就是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x018B132A2408EF8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"spe